1
00:00:08,000 --> 00:00:09,320
(The Underworld)

2
00:00:09,920 --> 00:00:12,080
(Shen Yanlin)

3
00:00:15,000 --> 00:00:17,940
♪Cruel world, where trust runs thin♪
(Ling Che)

4
00:00:19,600 --> 00:00:22,320
♪Blades clash. Who will rise above?♪
(Shuangdao Hui)

5
00:00:22,840 --> 00:00:28,040
♪Behind every smile, danger waits♪
(Dongshan Tai)

6
00:00:28,040 --> 00:00:30,520
(Fei Liu)

7
00:00:31,480 --> 00:00:35,080
♪Know your limits, know your worth♪
(Luo Song)

8
00:00:36,080 --> 00:00:39,800
♪Stand strong against the raging tide♪
(Annie)

9
00:00:40,520 --> 00:00:44,120
♪Ask how many times I've lost my way♪

10
00:00:44,720 --> 00:00:49,000
♪Storms rage on the road to power♪

11
00:00:49,000 --> 00:00:52,960
♪Let old promises fade into memory♪

12
00:00:52,960 --> 00:00:58,040
♪Alone and fearless, I won't back down♪

13
00:00:58,040 --> 00:01:02,120
♪Power is a crown forged in blood♪

14
00:01:02,120 --> 00:01:09,040
♪Brotherhood is shelter from the storm♪

15
00:01:12,200 --> 00:01:15,680
=The Underworld=

16
00:01:15,680 --> 00:01:17,520
(1999)

17
00:01:22,719 --> 00:01:23,400
Dongcheng Gang

18
00:01:23,680 --> 00:01:24,480
will never let you go!

19
00:01:54,520 --> 00:01:57,480
=Episode 1=

20
00:01:57,480 --> 00:01:59,920
(Shicheng, Wadang Kingdom,
Southeast Asia)

21
00:01:59,920 --> 00:02:03,000
Dongcheng Gang is the biggest gang
in Shicheng.

22
00:02:03,840 --> 00:02:05,560
Today is the retirement ceremony

23
00:02:05,560 --> 00:02:07,719
(Dongcheng Gang, Shuangdao Hui)
for Dongcheng Gang elder Bo Rong.

24
00:02:08,920 --> 00:02:09,960
(Dongcheng Gang, Dongshan Tai)

25
00:02:09,960 --> 00:02:12,000
Dongcheng Gang's power today

26
00:02:12,439 --> 00:02:14,199
(Dongcheng Gang Headquarters)
isn't built by Qin Hai alone.

27
00:02:14,639 --> 00:02:15,599
(Shicheng Police Department, Luo Song)
He has two right-hand men.

28
00:02:16,080 --> 00:02:16,560
The first one

29
00:02:18,479 --> 00:02:19,120
(Dongcheng Gang Member)
is Shuangdao Hui.

30
00:02:19,680 --> 00:02:20,479
A top enforcer.

31
00:02:21,039 --> 00:02:22,240
He fought his way to the top.

32
00:02:23,759 --> 00:02:24,479
The other one

33
00:02:25,400 --> 00:02:26,120
(Dongcheng Gang Member)
is Dongshan Tai.

34
00:02:26,919 --> 00:02:28,439
He looks calm and harmless,

35
00:02:28,680 --> 00:02:31,560
but he never leaves a trace.

36
00:02:31,840 --> 00:02:33,320
(Dongcheng Gang Headquarters)

37
00:02:43,360 --> 00:02:44,400
(Dongcheng Gang, Shen Yanlin)
Didn't anyone teach you the rules?

38
00:02:45,039 --> 00:02:46,039
(Dongcheng Gang, Bao Zun)
You think you can go in first?

39
00:02:49,719 --> 00:02:50,360
(Dongcheng Gang Member)
Shen Yanlin

40
00:02:51,319 --> 00:02:52,439
is Shuangdao Hui's right-hand man.

41
00:02:53,159 --> 00:02:54,080
But he lost his left hand.

42
00:02:55,639 --> 00:02:56,360
He made a name for himself

43
00:02:57,000 --> 00:02:58,360
through his brains and loyalty.

44
00:03:02,000 --> 00:03:03,159
What are you doing?

45
00:03:03,520 --> 00:03:04,599
In front of our founder's altar,

46
00:03:04,960 --> 00:03:05,840
who dares cause trouble?

47
00:03:06,520 --> 00:03:08,360
I lost my hand for our job.

48
00:03:09,159 --> 00:03:10,000
And you dare stand in my way?

49
00:03:11,039 --> 00:03:12,240
Who the hell do you think you are?

50
00:03:35,639 --> 00:03:37,759
Please. Tea for all the senior members.

51
00:03:40,319 --> 00:03:40,800
(Dongcheng Gang Member, Yong)
Yong.

52
00:03:41,280 --> 00:03:43,039
(Dongcheng Gang Member, Yong)
He was Qin's predecessor as shot-caller.

53
00:03:43,439 --> 00:03:44,960
He still carries weight
in Dongcheng Gang.

54
00:03:45,719 --> 00:03:46,599
Shuangdao Hui

55
00:03:47,120 --> 00:03:48,319
and Dongshan Tai's people

56
00:03:49,159 --> 00:03:50,280
have been fighting for nearly ten years.

57
00:03:51,039 --> 00:03:53,120
Today is Bo Rong's retirement ceremony.

58
00:03:53,800 --> 00:03:54,960
One spark could set everything off.

59
00:03:55,240 --> 00:03:56,719
So keep a close eye on them.

60
00:03:57,120 --> 00:03:58,639
(Criminal Investigation Unit)
Take down anyone who makes a move!

61
00:03:58,759 --> 00:03:59,960
Yes, sir!

62
00:04:05,960 --> 00:04:06,879
(Dongcheng Gang, Bo Rong)
We can't find Boss Hai.

63
00:04:07,840 --> 00:04:09,560
Still no news?

64
00:04:11,000 --> 00:04:12,280
Then let's begin.

65
00:04:12,439 --> 00:04:13,599
We can't miss the auspicious hour.

66
00:04:15,080 --> 00:04:17,200
(Dongcheng Gang Headquarters)

67
00:04:20,560 --> 00:04:22,839
Congratulations. Congratulations.

68
00:04:22,839 --> 00:04:23,879
Retiring from the underworld.

69
00:04:23,879 --> 00:04:25,120
Congratulations, Boss Rong.

70
00:04:47,240 --> 00:04:47,759
Boss Rong.

71
00:04:49,800 --> 00:04:50,279
Boss Rong.

72
00:05:13,839 --> 00:05:14,439
Boss Hui.

73
00:05:15,839 --> 00:05:16,600
It's from Boss Hai.

74
00:05:18,920 --> 00:05:19,480
A few days ago,

75
00:05:20,480 --> 00:05:22,199
you met with Boss Hai alone.

76
00:05:23,120 --> 00:05:23,720
Boss Hui.

77
00:05:25,199 --> 00:05:26,000
When it comes to territory

78
00:05:27,199 --> 00:05:28,199
and loyal followers,

79
00:05:29,000 --> 00:05:29,920
I'm one step behind you.

80
00:05:30,639 --> 00:05:31,600
Once Boss Hai is gone,

81
00:05:32,000 --> 00:05:34,519
who do you think is most likely

82
00:05:34,759 --> 00:05:36,120
to become the next shot-caller?

83
00:05:36,399 --> 00:05:37,199
What did you say?

84
00:05:37,560 --> 00:05:38,199
Say that again?

85
00:05:38,319 --> 00:05:38,879
What?

86
00:05:39,399 --> 00:05:40,120
Say it again!

87
00:05:44,440 --> 00:05:45,920
(Dongcheng Gang Headquarters)

88
00:05:49,240 --> 00:05:49,839
Get down!

89
00:05:50,240 --> 00:05:51,399
Don't move. Stay down.

90
00:06:04,000 --> 00:06:06,720
I'm Luo Song,
head of the Organized Crime Unit.

91
00:06:07,639 --> 00:06:08,720
I'm going to ask everyone

92
00:06:09,160 --> 00:06:11,360
to come back to the station
for a little chat.

93
00:06:12,600 --> 00:06:13,199
Please.

94
00:06:17,560 --> 00:06:19,920
(1994)

95
00:06:20,120 --> 00:06:21,279
Why did you choose me
for undercover work?

96
00:06:21,760 --> 00:06:23,240
(Shicheng Royal Police Academy
Application Form)

97
00:06:24,879 --> 00:06:26,240
Lin Che, have a seat.

98
00:06:26,640 --> 00:06:29,160
(Shicheng Royal Police Headquarters)

99
00:06:29,279 --> 00:06:31,399
Because among all the cadets,

100
00:06:31,759 --> 00:06:33,000
you had the best record.

101
00:06:33,759 --> 00:06:35,439
The gangs are running rampant.

102
00:06:36,040 --> 00:06:37,240
I need a fresh face

103
00:06:37,800 --> 00:06:38,680
to infiltrate them

104
00:06:39,480 --> 00:06:40,560
and find evidence of their crimes.

105
00:06:41,600 --> 00:06:42,600
I believe your abilities

106
00:06:42,600 --> 00:06:44,279
and potential make you the right choice.

107
00:06:45,639 --> 00:06:46,319
I know

108
00:06:47,360 --> 00:06:48,759
you want to join the Criminal Division.

109
00:06:50,879 --> 00:06:52,360
(Shicheng Royal Police Headquarters)
Every police officer carries

110
00:06:52,360 --> 00:06:53,959
(Loyalty Guards Our Glory)
the determination to uphold justice.

111
00:06:55,000 --> 00:06:56,839
But there's somewhere else
that needs you more.

112
00:06:58,000 --> 00:06:59,720
The Dongcheng and Nanhu gangs'

113
00:06:59,720 --> 00:07:00,720
ongoing feud

114
00:07:01,319 --> 00:07:03,480
is threatening Shicheng's safety.

115
00:07:04,240 --> 00:07:06,360
That's the real battlefield.

116
00:07:07,639 --> 00:07:09,240
It needs a true fighter.

117
00:07:10,600 --> 00:07:12,199
But I need you to know this first.

118
00:07:13,240 --> 00:07:14,399
It could be extremely dangerous.

119
00:07:15,279 --> 00:07:16,279
You may not come back.

120
00:07:17,360 --> 00:07:17,839
So,

121
00:07:18,600 --> 00:07:20,120
I'll give you three days
to think about it.

122
00:07:21,160 --> 00:07:21,480
No need.

123
00:07:25,000 --> 00:07:25,519
(Probationary Officer, Lin Che)
I'll do it.

124
00:07:25,519 --> 00:07:26,960
(Dongcheng Gang, Ling Che)

125
00:07:27,240 --> 00:07:32,200
(Shicheng Police Department)

126
00:07:43,279 --> 00:07:44,879
If you can't read, press here.

127
00:07:45,959 --> 00:07:46,920
What a hassle.

128
00:07:50,120 --> 00:07:51,120
(Applicant: Shen Yanlin)

129
00:07:51,120 --> 00:07:52,160
Boss Hui can leave now, right?

130
00:07:52,800 --> 00:07:53,439
Don't get cocky.

131
00:07:53,639 --> 00:07:54,240
Once we find the evidence,

132
00:07:54,360 --> 00:07:55,480
I'll bring Shuangdao Hui in
for questioning anytime.

133
00:07:56,720 --> 00:07:57,439
Evidence?

134
00:07:58,079 --> 00:07:59,240
Our organization

135
00:07:59,519 --> 00:08:00,959
is full of law-abiding citizens.

136
00:08:01,319 --> 00:08:02,399
What are you looking at?

137
00:08:03,800 --> 00:08:05,560
Thirty years ago, Shicheng

138
00:08:05,560 --> 00:08:07,160
was so poor that even thieves
avoided it.

139
00:08:08,199 --> 00:08:09,319
If it weren't for us,

140
00:08:09,720 --> 00:08:10,879
how would those people survive?

141
00:08:11,560 --> 00:08:12,879
Thanks to you?

142
00:08:14,360 --> 00:08:15,759
Go to hell.

143
00:08:16,720 --> 00:08:17,720
He's not wrong.

144
00:08:18,839 --> 00:08:19,879
The police department's salaries

145
00:08:20,560 --> 00:08:23,240
might even come from taxes paid
by gang members like you.

146
00:08:24,040 --> 00:08:25,120
That's why

147
00:08:27,720 --> 00:08:30,040
Officer Luo is the one
who understands how things work.

148
00:08:31,560 --> 00:08:32,960
Do me a favor and send this message.

149
00:08:33,960 --> 00:08:35,440
Next time you pull a stunt like this,

150
00:08:36,519 --> 00:08:37,960
I won't be so polite.

151
00:08:40,279 --> 00:08:40,960
Sure.

152
00:08:48,200 --> 00:08:53,680
(Loyalty Hall)

153
00:08:57,600 --> 00:08:59,600
(Respect the Law)

154
00:09:00,159 --> 00:09:01,440
About Boss Hai,

155
00:09:01,840 --> 00:09:02,559
what does everyone think?

156
00:09:03,159 --> 00:09:04,360
(Dongcheng Gang, Fei Liu)
Why does it matter?

157
00:09:05,679 --> 00:09:06,759
Boss Hai is gone.

158
00:09:07,240 --> 00:09:08,519
Dongcheng Gang

159
00:09:09,000 --> 00:09:09,759
can't fall into chaos.

160
00:09:10,240 --> 00:09:11,480
The shot-caller's position

161
00:09:12,360 --> 00:09:13,519
can't stay vacant for long.

162
00:09:15,840 --> 00:09:17,240
Boss Hai's death remains a mystery.

163
00:09:17,639 --> 00:09:18,720
The killer hasn't been found.

164
00:09:19,440 --> 00:09:21,120
Who has the right to take his seat?

165
00:09:21,360 --> 00:09:23,879
(Respect the Law. Keep Your Honor.)

166
00:09:23,879 --> 00:09:25,320
Boss Hui is right.

167
00:09:25,840 --> 00:09:27,000
The person who killed Boss Hai

168
00:09:27,440 --> 00:09:28,360
must be found.

169
00:09:29,039 --> 00:09:30,360
But the position

170
00:09:30,840 --> 00:09:31,840
still needs someone to fill it.

171
00:09:32,120 --> 00:09:33,440
It's not even been seven days
since his death.

172
00:09:34,120 --> 00:09:34,919
And you're already in such a hurry?

173
00:09:35,559 --> 00:09:36,039
(Loyalty Hall)
Boss Hui,

174
00:09:36,960 --> 00:09:37,960
don't misunderstand.

175
00:09:38,399 --> 00:09:40,080
We're all working for us all.

176
00:09:41,240 --> 00:09:41,960
Right now,

177
00:09:42,559 --> 00:09:43,679
with no shot-caller,

178
00:09:44,600 --> 00:09:46,000
I'm afraid Dongcheng will fall apart,

179
00:09:46,480 --> 00:09:48,159
and the brothers will lose direction.

180
00:09:49,679 --> 00:09:51,679
(Loyalty Hall)
We haven't even found Boss Hai's body.

181
00:09:52,519 --> 00:09:53,399
And you people

182
00:09:53,919 --> 00:09:56,120
are already fighting over
who gets the seat.

183
00:09:56,360 --> 00:09:57,399
How does that look?

184
00:09:59,559 --> 00:10:00,879
Normally,

185
00:10:01,399 --> 00:10:03,000
the election would start next year.

186
00:10:03,519 --> 00:10:05,360
But Boss Hai's death came too suddenly.

187
00:10:06,559 --> 00:10:07,639
Rules

188
00:10:08,120 --> 00:10:09,399
are made by people.

189
00:10:11,600 --> 00:10:14,000
Whoever can be the first

190
00:10:14,200 --> 00:10:16,000
to find Boss Hai's killer

191
00:10:16,960 --> 00:10:17,559
gets

192
00:10:17,960 --> 00:10:18,759
my vote.

193
00:10:18,759 --> 00:10:19,360
(Loyalty Hall)

194
00:10:26,000 --> 00:10:28,279
(Dongcheng Tiger)

195
00:10:28,279 --> 00:10:29,559
One word from Yong,

196
00:10:29,759 --> 00:10:31,279
now everyone's eyes

197
00:10:31,279 --> 00:10:32,080
are on me

198
00:10:32,320 --> 00:10:33,120
and Dongshan Tai.

199
00:10:33,879 --> 00:10:34,399
Lin,

200
00:10:35,000 --> 00:10:35,720
take Che

201
00:10:36,200 --> 00:10:37,440
and investigate Boss Hai's case.

202
00:10:38,240 --> 00:10:39,240
I want to be the first

203
00:10:39,399 --> 00:10:40,759
to find his killer.

204
00:10:41,799 --> 00:10:42,559
Got it.

205
00:10:43,440 --> 00:10:45,559
The cops have locked down
the information so tightly.

206
00:10:46,320 --> 00:10:47,240
I have a feeling...

207
00:10:48,440 --> 00:10:49,159
the killer

208
00:10:49,639 --> 00:10:50,679
isn't an outsider.

209
00:10:52,440 --> 00:10:53,240
I think so too.

210
00:10:54,240 --> 00:10:55,480
Whoever knew Boss Hai's movements

211
00:10:55,879 --> 00:10:56,960
and left no trace behind

212
00:10:57,480 --> 00:10:58,960
has to be either Nanhu Gang
or someone on our side.

213
00:10:59,480 --> 00:11:00,000
Bro.

214
00:11:00,960 --> 00:11:02,279
Could it really be Dongshan Tai?

215
00:11:02,600 --> 00:11:03,759
(Dongcheng Tiger)

216
00:11:03,759 --> 00:11:05,600
It's too early to jump to conclusions.

217
00:11:06,360 --> 00:11:07,799
Just focus on the investigation.

218
00:11:08,440 --> 00:11:09,480
Now that Boss Hai is gone,

219
00:11:09,919 --> 00:11:11,600
you two are the only people I trust.

220
00:11:12,000 --> 00:11:12,639
Give me a hand.

221
00:11:13,480 --> 00:11:14,120
Don't worry, bro.

222
00:11:15,159 --> 00:11:15,879
(Dongcheng Tiger)
Here, Boss Hui.

223
00:11:31,120 --> 00:11:31,559
Boss Lin.

224
00:11:32,279 --> 00:11:33,480
Where do we start looking?

225
00:11:36,879 --> 00:11:38,960
I told you to call me Lin
when we're alone.

226
00:11:39,440 --> 00:11:41,759
"Boss Lin" sounds weird coming from you.

227
00:11:42,919 --> 00:11:43,639
Idiot.

228
00:11:46,159 --> 00:11:47,200
Did you just call me an idiot?

229
00:11:49,480 --> 00:11:50,720
How could I ever be mad at you?

230
00:11:51,639 --> 00:11:53,240
Disgusting. Get lost.

231
00:11:57,840 --> 00:11:59,879
Those guys who were always
around Boss Hai,

232
00:12:00,279 --> 00:12:01,000
any news on them?

233
00:12:01,960 --> 00:12:03,279
After something happened to Boss Hai,

234
00:12:04,039 --> 00:12:05,919
his men were probably...

235
00:12:08,759 --> 00:12:09,879
But according to Boss Hai's driver,

236
00:12:10,320 --> 00:12:12,639
one of his street guys, Mao,

237
00:12:13,600 --> 00:12:15,639
disappeared after Boss Hai's death.

238
00:12:18,480 --> 00:12:19,159
Mao?

239
00:12:20,639 --> 00:12:21,240
Mao.

240
00:12:38,480 --> 00:12:42,280
♪Live by the blade, die by the blade♪

241
00:12:44,920 --> 00:12:48,320
♪Ride the waves
and you may drown in them♪

242
00:12:50,600 --> 00:12:53,000
♪If you gamble your life, go all in♪

243
00:12:53,760 --> 00:12:57,320
♪Leave it to fate. Take it if you dare♪

244
00:13:04,160 --> 00:13:06,760
♪They say every brother has his price♪

245
00:13:06,760 --> 00:13:09,960
♪They say this world swallows you whole♪

246
00:13:10,600 --> 00:13:13,320
♪I won this life on a roll of the dice♪

247
00:13:13,320 --> 00:13:16,520
♪I staked my soul to set myself free♪

248
00:13:16,600 --> 00:13:20,880
♪I was born too tough to break♪

249
00:13:23,680 --> 00:13:28,200
♪Tough enough to walk this road to ruin♪

250
00:13:30,040 --> 00:13:34,240
♪This is my fate. I won't fight it♪

251
00:13:37,000 --> 00:13:40,560
♪I'd rather call my own shots♪

252
00:13:43,600 --> 00:13:46,120
♪Incense fades,
but the ashes still burn♪

253
00:13:46,120 --> 00:13:49,560
♪Every prayer at the altar rings hollow♪
